Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.90,0:00:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,By the time you'd reached\Nme, it was too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.90,0:00:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Death has me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.84,0:00:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.22,0:00:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Up above them, it's a helicopter!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.36,0:00:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, those morons\Nhave no means of escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.96,0:00:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Admittedly, the weather is quite lovely\Nfor a blind date at the Coliseum.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.16,0:00:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a shame that Green Tea\Nand I will have to rain on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.48,0:00:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to exterminate the mold before\Nit has a chance to reach the Coliseum.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.10,0:00:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati, our underground friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.92,0:00:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving him to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.20,0:00:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.60,0:00:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.90,0:00:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.81,0:00:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.90,0:00:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.14,0:00:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,My first victim will be you, Bucciarati.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.24,0:01:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You can make the difference between the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.04,0:01:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,emotions and the love of\Ndarkness in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.84,0:01:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.50,0:01:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to show you the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.82,0:01:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to show you the life you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.62,0:01:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to show you the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.30,0:01:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Lor everyone will be Re buna. Woah woah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.58,0:02:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The sounds of fear that I have to get
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.32,0:02:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Stalking the world to the point
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.04,0:02:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean it's just like a death
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.08,0:02:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,When we meet the world in the\Nworld, I will live in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.82,0:02:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And I will leave the terminus.\NAnd I will keep the end of this
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.34,0:02:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.30,0:02:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Brick, son of a porch, no wait it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.70,0:02:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The word you want is bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.82,0:02:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.44,0:03:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What, you some kind of language expert?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.42,0:03:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost forgot I'm supposed\Nto get this on tape.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.22,0:03:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Killing you shouldn't\Ntake more than a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.16,0:03:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.34,0:03:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Zippermen!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.24,0:03:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,How did he react so fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.24,0:03:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If this fight's going to be a one-on-one,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.46,0:03:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,then there won't be a need\Nfor me to go underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.72,0:03:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Nearly got me there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.30,0:03:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,His powers eclipse Zippermans,\Nboth in strength and speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.28,0:03:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.90,0:03:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's where his strength comes from.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.58,0:03:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the elbow strikes to the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.54,0:03:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He's using the recoil\Nto augment his punches.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.20,0:03:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That speed,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.34,0:03:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,it's almost like a boxer trying to spring\Noff the ropes to get some added snap.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.72,0:04:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Arie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.00,0:04:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, I ain't got all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.18,0:04:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Grrrrrr!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.16,0:04:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I thought, there's not a trace\Nof mold on you, even though you fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.90,0:04:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought Chocolata's green tea was supposed\Nto ravage any living thing it touches.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.26,0:04:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So how the hell are\Nyou still in one piece?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.52,0:04:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I'll just have to do\Nit the old-fashioned way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.74,0:04:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Beating you over and over again\Nuntil your body stops moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.04,0:04:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to my sanctuary!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.86,0:04:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno Giovanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.38,0:04:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The new thorn in my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.84,0:05:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn bread is able to breathe\Nlife into inanimate objects,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.16,0:05:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,just like he did with\Nthose straight bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.54,0:05:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The plans gripping this helicopter\Ncouldn't have come from any other source.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.74,0:05:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you're clever, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.34,0:05:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, think again
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.16,0:05:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Because your pathetic life-granting\Npowers are impotent before my green tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.32,0:05:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch us rot every one of\Nyour vines We're gonna take
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.16,0:05:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,off whether they like it or\Nnot so rain down those spores.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.48,0:05:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for us to whack a few weeds
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.70,0:05:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,W-what the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.28,0:05:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This damn thing won't budge at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.24,0:05:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me we're really stuck here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.30,0:05:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, piece of junk! Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.66,0:05:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nearly reached full maturity,\Nand its grip is coming in strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.80,0:05:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That helicopter isn't gonna\Nfly off anywhere soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.84,0:05:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista, we just have to\Nclimb up to the cockpit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.46,0:05:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Great, let's climb a tree, then again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.94,0:05:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I could just shoot him from here now\Nthat he's within range of my bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.50,0:05:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, go make Daddy proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.44,0:06:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Our point of impact is that\NKatsune skull! What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.84,0:06:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Whaaaaat?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.26,0:06:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.18,0:06:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The guys are saying the Stranzo's\Nnowhere near the helicopter!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.82,0:06:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What the frickin' hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.80,0:06:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he just run off?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.48,0:06:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nowhere to hide in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.48,0:06:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And he couldn't have gone outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.80,0:06:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, get your feelers out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.58,0:06:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hunt his ass down fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.78,0:06:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Number two!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.04,0:06:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Number three!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.50,0:06:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit, Mista, you gotta call us back quickly\Nbefore something else terrible happens!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.62,0:06:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista, what the...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.56,0:06:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.82,0:06:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, fellas!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.04,0:06:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell happened to you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.02,0:06:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.44,0:06:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Why couldn't any of us find him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.24,0:06:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Stands are limited to one\Nper person, I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.44,0:06:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy can attack you\Nwith some killer mold
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.78,0:06:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,that eats your body\Nwhen you lose altitude,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.52,0:06:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,but that's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.68,0:06:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,He shouldn't be able to do anything else!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.50,0:06:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Run, number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.04,0:07:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Number six, number seven!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.70,0:07:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't defeat him, so go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.50,0:07:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, get on out of\Nhere, as fast as you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.72,0:07:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy's scary deadly!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.36,0:07:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista, you have to get your\Nbullets out of there now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.30,0:07:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Withdraw your stand right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.52,0:07:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No can't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.70,0:07:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This bastard's got his\Nclaws in there deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.04,0:07:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't withdraw jack shit right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.36,0:07:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like my judgment was way off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.42,0:07:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.66,0:07:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.92,0:07:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Just send me in there and I'll fix this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.90,0:07:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll bring everyone back\Nwithout a problem, I swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.92,0:07:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.83,0:07:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not a promise you can keep.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.60,0:07:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a good reason why he's holding\Non to the bullets he's destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.50,0:07:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He knows Mista won't be able to heal\Nas long as his stand is activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.72,0:07:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.66,0:07:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.06,0:07:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to mention,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.28,0:07:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,he's counting on you to\Nrush in there to save the
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.44,0:08:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,day because he knows that\Nyou're the only one left,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.70,0:08:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,and if you die, so does Mista.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.96,0:08:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have known.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.50,0:08:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't a guy you can\Njust shoot down from afar.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.82,0:08:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista, I'm leaving\NTrish and Narancia here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.14,0:08:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.62,0:08:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch over them!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.28,0:08:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista, Mista! Number five.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.94,0:08:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to follow him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.66,0:08:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.57,0:08:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You watched your nose back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.86,0:08:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this bullet with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.22,0:08:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm picking up life energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.72,0:08:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So I don't get why the bullets\Ncouldn't get a lock on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.00,0:08:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't nail down his exact spot, but I\Nknow for sure he hasn't left the chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.46,0:08:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,In which case...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.78,0:08:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Strike him down, Golden Wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.70,0:08:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There's still nothing inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.48,0:08:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this guy up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.52,0:08:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This makes zero sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.18,0:09:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way he could hide in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.80,0:09:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Medical supplies?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.58,0:09:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he some kind of doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.52,0:09:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The chaos is spreading.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.34,0:09:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty soon it'll engulf the Colosseum.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.08,0:09:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We're out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.46,0:09:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to finish this right now\Nor we're all gonna be screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.72,0:09:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The, the real enemy is, ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.14,0:09:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, number one, come to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.24,0:09:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No, get away from it, Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.34,0:09:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're walking right into a trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.06,0:09:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.66,0:09:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened? Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.50,0:09:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Journal, be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.62,0:10:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Journal!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.62,0:10:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Curiosity.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.53,0:10:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the primary fuel in the\Nengine of intellectual development.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.80,0:10:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.72,0:10:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I never thought I'd be\Nquite this grateful for all
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.26,0:10:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,those human experiments I\Nconducted during my youth.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.22,0:10:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So many hours I spent analyzing\Nand recording which segments
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.66,0:10:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,of the human body could be\Nremoved without inducing death.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.10,0:10:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It shouldn't surprise\Nyou that I therefore know
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.50,0:10:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,exactly which veins I must seal\Nto stop emerging. Lucky me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.98,0:10:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Green Tea's mold can perform\Nthis critical sealing,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.70,0:10:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,allowing me to maintain my\Nfreedom of movement and the
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.22,0:10:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,ability to hide wherever I\Nplease even while I'm dissecting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.94,0:10:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't afford to fall\Nany further, Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.22,0:10:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That horrible moat's gonna get\Nyou if you sink lower than that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.12,0:10:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.60,0:11:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to climb for your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.82,0:11:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We all sometimes have those moments\Nof pure and perfect ecstasy, don't we,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.74,0:11:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno Giovanna?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.60,0:11:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,There are two scenarios I can think\Nof where such joy shines on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.72,0:11:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The first one starts with despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.04,0:11:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,When a desolate situation becomes\Nhopeful, one starts to feel blessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.98,0:11:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The very moment your oversized\Nweeds snatch me out of the sky,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.18,0:11:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll admit I felt something\Nclose to true fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.94,0:11:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And boy, oh boy, was it\Na dreadful sensation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.46,0:11:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But I cut through the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.88,0:11:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,My years of experience\Ncombined with my sheer
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.30,0:11:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,inner fortitude helped me turn the tables.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.80,0:11:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And let me say, the feelings awaiting\Nme on the other side were blissful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.92,0:11:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what a rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.20,0:11:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The golden wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.76,0:11:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Who said you could get up?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.50,0:11:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,John, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.41,0:11:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you really forget that I still had\Ntwo legs crawling about to hear you,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.86,0:11:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,stupid dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.38,0:12:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And just what I was about to share with\Nyou, the second source of happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.10,0:12:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,which occurs when beholding\Nthe weak and pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.76,0:12:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.40,0:12:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Long before you hit the cold, hard ground,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.16,0:12:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,my green tea's malt will have already\Nreduced your pitiful body to drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.30,0:12:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Jono, I need this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.22,0:12:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Now's your chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.22,0:12:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.13,0:12:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Run back inside the chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.38,0:12:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.29,0:12:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I owe you one!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.21,0:12:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Beat the poopy out of him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.38,0:12:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're just getting on my nerves!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.26,0:12:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure how many times I can\Nteach you this lesson, my dear boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.96,0:12:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But I've got plenty of spores to spare!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.56,0:12:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to know a funny thing\Nabout these branches of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.02,0:13:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,They're also living things\Nthat my mole loves to eat,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.82,0:13:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,but I hope they don't start to sag.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.58,0:13:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't you stand there and\Nyou're gonna jump! Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.88,0:13:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, baby, I want more. Show me more. Let\Nme see that pretty-faced train of all hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.70,0:13:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I'm all tingly,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.36,0:13:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,you'd think I'd be used to it by now,\Nbut the sweet sight never gets old.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.16,0:13:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Just be sure to cheat this way so I can get\Na good look before you go ahead and die!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.02,0:13:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a perfect hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.93,0:13:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Benny, looks like my aim for your\Npropellers was right on the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.60,0:13:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a perfect hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.88,0:13:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew your putrid mold would\Nnaturally end up consuming my branches,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.88,0:13:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,but when a branch separates\Nfrom its body, it dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.12,0:13:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,All that's left is wood, and\Nbecause you destroyed the branch,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.88,0:14:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,it returned to bullet form.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.70,0:14:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and before I forget about all\Nthat creepy happiness bullshit,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.62,0:14:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,it might surprise you to hear that seeing\Nyou like this, it brings me no joy at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.98,0:14:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.06,0:14:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Though maybe it's cuz I'm the one\Nwho's been winning this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.32,0:14:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.50,0:14:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You really went and pulled it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.28,0:14:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Good job, Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.92,0:14:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez, talk about close!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.66,0:14:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He managed to stop his mold from spreading\Nfurther in not a second too soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.18,0:14:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, there's still Mista's\Nbubbles to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.40,0:14:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,With that nasty moldy\Nman gone on the board
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.32,0:14:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't mean to cut your celebration short,\Nbut if you don't mind scooch a little
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.00,0:14:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.00,0:14:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm overthinking things a bit here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.74,0:14:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,However, I get the feeling that Cioccolata\Nguy's faking that he's just playing dead
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.90,0:14:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey dick, no one's\Ngonna buy that lame act.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.28,0:14:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I know exactly what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.24,0:14:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You're plotting
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.42,0:15:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now you're likely\Nthinking to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.66,0:15:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe just maybe
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.62,0:15:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If I could only move\Na little bit that way,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.12,0:15:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,then I'd be able to escape through the\Ntrench before that stronzo could get to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.12,0:15:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll disperse more mold.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.78,0:15:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what you're planning\Nin that sick head, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.16,0:15:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Full disclosure, I'm pretty badly injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.24,0:15:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,My right lung has suffered\Na sizable puncture.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.12,0:15:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,My subclavian artery\Nis completely severed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.88,0:15:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got four cracked ribs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.42,0:15:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,not to mention my humerus and\Ncarpals are pretty much shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.68,0:15:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Climbing all the way up there to get to\Nyou would present a challenge, I would say.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.96,0:15:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,How lucky for me, then, that my\Nstand is none other than Golden Wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.84,0:15:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It has power in spades\Nand a range of two meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.92,0:15:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That means you fall well within its reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.10,0:15:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll only take an instant\Nfor us to crush you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.92,0:15:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He's dead, Journal!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.30,0:15:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You already got him right in the noggin!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.96,0:15:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.87,0:16:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can behave when I get up\Nthere, then I promise to show
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.84,0:16:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,you a little mercy and you'll\Ncome out of this with your life
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.70,0:16:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm throwing you a rope
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.06,0:16:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So what'll it be I'm gonna start\Nmaking my way to you think hard
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.02,0:16:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You're getting nowhere near me. Look\Nbehind you, you bungling sucker!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.74,0:16:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, whose hand is that\Non Mista and the turtle?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.78,0:16:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.88,0:16:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The entire time you were\Nrunning your worthless mouth,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.38,0:16:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,you didn't even notice\Nmy right arm sneaking
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.48,0:16:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,toward your little friends\Nin the shadows once,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.76,0:16:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,now, did ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.10,0:16:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Mista's throat will\Nhave to pay the price.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.88,0:16:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems you have to choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.78,0:16:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Either you can pursue me, or\Nyou can heal your precious pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.06,0:16:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's winning now, worthless fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.00,0:16:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.70,0:16:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You were close.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.06,0:17:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I drew out my speech in\Norder to buy myself time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.14,0:17:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The bullet that tore a hole through\Nyour head still had to mature,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.64,0:17:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,before eventually making its\Nway back to the initial wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.70,0:17:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The shrapnel that drew it\Nwas lodged in your skull,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.52,0:17:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,and returned to its\Noriginal form as a beetle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.58,0:17:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,One whose growth I happened\Nto accelerate greatly
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.20,0:17:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,with golden wind when I\Naimed for the propellers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.00,0:17:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to be certain you\Nwere completely neutralized,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.78,0:17:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,meaning I had to finish you off, whether\Nor not I could still hear a heartbeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.88,0:17:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But, but you said that\Nif I just stayed still,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.64,0:17:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,that I, I would still\Nmake it out of this alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.52,0:17:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.00,0:17:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If you really thought I was being\Nserious, then you're the worthless fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.26,0:17:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't spare pieces of shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.22,0:17:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you just call me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.34,0:18:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We're done! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.80,0:18:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Journal!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.42,0:18:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Look who's waking up from his nappy-nap!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.38,0:18:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate me, mister, I missed you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.42,0:18:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.40,0:18:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd that get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.64,0:18:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Cioccolata drop it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.18,0:18:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.28,0:18:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Was he on the phone this entire time?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.06,0:18:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't even see it. Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.58,0:18:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell did he call?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.98,0:18:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, come on, pick up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.54,0:19:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Cioccolata.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.45,0:19:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the holdup over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.66,0:19:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't usually take this long. Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.52,0:19:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.52,0:19:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this flashing thingamadoodle?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.58,0:19:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I press something, or...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.70,0:19:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, that's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.10,0:19:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It means I got a message in my\Nstupid inbox, no frickin' duh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.46,0:19:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's see here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.72,0:19:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, there's two!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.68,0:19:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And wait, I don't remember him calling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.72,0:19:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it when I was chasing\NBucciarati earlier today?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.74,0:19:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Seko, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.50,0:19:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Chocolata's back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.00,0:19:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I took care of that little\Ntwerp with the gun, Mista. Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.14,0:19:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But that newcomer Giorno looks like he's\Ntrying to come up to the helicopter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.76,0:19:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The sad fool can climb all he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.42,0:19:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Victory is already mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.20,0:19:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You finish off that Bucciarati.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.08,0:19:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Do that and I'll give you\Nthe bestest backscratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.58,0:19:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't think I forgot the sugar cubes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.08,0:19:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready, boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.28,0:19:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Here they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.62,0:19:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,How many do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.22,0:20:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,How about two?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.46,0:20:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, you rascal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.30,0:20:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you five.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.66,0:20:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm winding up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.24,0:20:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta catch him\Nwith your muzzle, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.20,0:20:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No hands allowed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.16,0:20:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Seko.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.52,0:20:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You and I are unstoppable,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.22,0:20:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,and it is the duty of those who are\Nstrong like us to rule over the weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.02,0:20:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,One might say we, the mighty,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.08,0:20:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,were charged by the heavens to\Nguide the frail and the feeble.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.40,0:20:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if the boss numbers among them,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.84,0:20:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,not only will I destroy those irksome\Nlouts, I will transcend the boss himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.02,0:20:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And you shall be by my side,\Nbecause you are strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.56,0:20:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno's here. I must go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.64,0:20:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.44,0:20:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to know that you\Nare very dear to me, Sekko.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.42,0:20:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk to you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.92,0:21:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That malicious mole should\Nbe far behind by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.46,0:22:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,They were accusing. They've always been\Na knowing. What is just fiction? Or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.26,0:22:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,is the truth They have a mission They
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.58,0:22:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,are the passion But they dare to tell us
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.98,0:22:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What's bad and what's good? Stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.20,0:22:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Join us. Come on. Just
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.54,0:22:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Say this. We are the
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.66,0:22:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Power. Cause there's a future. Cause we
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.16,0:22:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,are the fighters Just fighting for a ride
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.02,0:23:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
